From 339979aec758d49e2b675f2bd611fb7ddffd81a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 13:26:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(zi-expert): rebrand the in-app AI assistant persona to
 ZICHAT (name + avatar)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Renames the chat assistant users see from "ZI" to "ZICHAT" and gives it the new
ZICHAT mascot avatar (public/zono/zichat.png). Updates the chat widget — header
name, greeting, floating launcher aria-label, input placeholder, footer, loading
label — and the system prompt so the assistant introduces itself as ZICHAT. Also
renames every broker-facing mention across login, my-day cockpit, office command
center, getting-started, daily plan, admin knowledge/diagnostics/learning/health
views, activation and the built-in knowledge base.

Intentionally unchanged: code identifiers (ZIWidget/ZIAvatar/…), routes, CSS
classes, code comments, and the English admin section titles "ZI Learning" /
"ZI Diagnostics".

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Cm5NAh92cekdimerQbEsCW
